                                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                  "width": "fill_container",
                                  "content": "First, I name what is actually unknown. Then I separate reversible decisions from expensive ones, find the smallest useful experiment, and create a cadence where learning turns into a decision. Ambiguity gets less scary when it has structure.",
