                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "The client was seeking to develop a methodology and supporting tooling to assess the impact of integrating Generative AI technologies into daily operations, with a focus on workforce size and distribution, project cost, and organizational capacity.",
